---
const links = [
  { label: "Nuevo proyecto", icon: "＋", primary: true },
  { label: "Explorar", icon: "◎" },
  { label: "Proyectos", icon: "▤" },
  { label: "Ajustes", icon: "⚙" },
]
---
<aside class="sidebar">
  <div class="brand"><span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">◈</span> CodeZard</div>
  <nav>
    {links.map((l) => (
      <button class:list={["nav", l.primary && "nav--primary"]}>
        <span aria-hidden="true">{l.icon}</span> {l.label}
      </button>
    ))}
  </nav>
  <p class="note">
    El historial vive solo en esta sesión. Persistirlo es una decisión de producto pendiente.
  </p>
</aside>

<style>
  .sidebar { width: 236px; flex: none; background: var(--surface); border-right: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.25rem 1rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }
  .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .mark { color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.3rem; }
  nav { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.35rem; }
  .nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.7rem; width: 100%; text-align: left; background: none; border: 0; color: var(--text-dim); border-radius: 10px; padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem; }
  .nav:hover { background: var(--surface-2); color: var(--text); }
  .nav--primary { background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); font-weight: 600; justify-content: center; }
  .nav--primary:hover { background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); }
  .note { margin-top: auto; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.45; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .sidebar { display: none; } }
</style>
